 "intro": {
  "de": "Auf Märkten kannst du manchmal handeln: 깎아 주세요. In Kaufhäusern gelten feste Preise.\nKarten werden fast überall angenommen. Tüten kosten oft etwas extra.",
  "en": "At markets you can sometimes haggle: 깎아 주세요. Department stores have fixed prices.\nCards are accepted almost everywhere. Bags often cost a little extra."
 },
